Character name: Aldric
Character description: A tall mage.
Character personality: Calm and wise.

Write:
- scenario [50–100 words]: The circumstances where roleplay begins. Frames the opening situation.
- first_mes [150–300 words]: Aldric's opening message — THE most important field. This length calibrates every future reply. Write as a narrative scene: interleave action descriptions (*action*) with natural dialogue. End with something that invites the user to engage.

Return JSON: {"scenario": "...", "first_mes": "..."}"
`;
